  "tab.menus": "Menus",
  "tab.menus.desc": "Editable game menus.\n\nEach menu has a key that opens it, a title and a list of sections.\n\nEach section uses a renderer type: skills, consumables, equipment, list/options (with actions), controls or stats/flags.\n\nFor list/options types write the items as JSON (name, description and action). For stats/flags write the list of flags to show.",
  "tab.monedas": "Monedas",
  "tab.monedas.desc": "Game currencies (first-class counters).\n\nEach currency has an id, a label, an initial value, an icon, a color and can be marked as principal (only one).\n\nEvent conditions/actions use has_moneda / give_moneda / remove_moneda.\n\nThe \"escamas\" currency stays tied to the snake's length (shim).",
