  "tab.audio.desc": "Game audio library.\n\nRegister BGM (background music) and SFX (sound effects) tracks, each with volume and loop settings.\n\nIn a later phase you will assign them: to elements (e.g. food makes a sound when picked up), to maps/scenes (per-level music) and to events (play_bgm, play_sfx).",
  "tab.minigames.desc": "Minigames with their own mechanics.\n\nAvailable types: collection (timed), timing (key sequence) and puzzle (grid).\n\nThey are defined here and triggered from events with the \"Start minigame\" action. The result is applied to flags to continue the story.",
  "tab.scripts.desc": "Python script editor.\n\nCreate, edit and delete .py scripts that the game runs as custom logic.\n\nUse the New / Save / Delete buttons. Type the script name and its content in the editor.",
  "tab.assets.desc": "Project asset library.\n\nImport images (backgrounds, characters, CG, sprites, icons) and audio (BGM, SFX).\n\nEach asset is referenced by ID from other panels (elements, audio, scenes, etc.).",
  "tab.characters.desc": "Characters for dialogues and visual novels.\n\nDefine name, text color and emotions (normal, happy, sad, angry, blushing, surprised).\n\nEach character is referenced by ID from the dialogues.",
  "tab.scenes.desc": "Story scenes.\n\nOrganize chapters and scenes (dialogue, level, minigame, etc.) with entry conditions.\n\nScenes chain together to drive the game narrative.",
  "tab.screens.desc": "Game screens.\n\nConfigure the boot screens and the text screens (cutscenes) shown at startup or triggered by events."
}
